admin-stats-help = Key figures of one area under a shared title: equal cells divided by hairlines that wrap to the available space. A linked figure is entirely clickable and completes its accessible name with the action; pending work tints the cell and always shows a visible word.
admin-cards-title = Cards, states and tags
admin-cards-help = ui-card gathers the kind, title, state, description, facts and actions of one item; ui::state shows enabled, disabled or blocked with a visible word; ui-tag and ui-facts carry short labels and key data.
